<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY AUG PPI UP 1.7PCT MTH/MTH, 20.9 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY AUG PPI UP 1.7PCT MTH/MTH, 20.9 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's producer price index (PPI) rose in  August 1.7 percent month-on-month and 20,9 percent year-on-year, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said in a statement on Thursday.  </p>
<p>    PRODUCER PRICES (pct)   Aug 1996     July 1996     Aug 1995</p>
<p>    month-on-month change    + 1.7	   + 0.5	  + 1.3</p>
<p>    year-on-year change	+20.9	   +20.4	  n.a.</p>
<p>NOTE - Domestic industrial sales prices rose by 22.5 percent in August in year-on-year terms, while export prices went up by 16.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 266 2410</p>
</text>
